| Category         | Metric                                |
| ---------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Acquisition      | New users per week                    |
| Activation       | First meaningful interaction          |
| Engagement       | Interactions per active user          |
| Retention        | D1, D7, D30                           |
| Social growth    | Invitations sent and accepted         |
| Content          | Contributions per active user         |
| Community health | Active communities                    |
